# Rule: SignZeroReflection
# Before (rejected):
# forall x R:
#     sign(x)=0
#     =>:
#         x=0
# Former verifier behavior: rejected in the search_proof phase.
# Now (verified directly):
forall x R:
    sign(x)=0
    =>:
        x=0

# Boundary: Requires an actual sign(x)=0 equality and a real argument; arbitrary x=0 rejects.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/sign_zero_reflection.lit
# Regression: tests/unit/execute/legacy_six_simple_bt/tests.rs
